OL,3,GNEWSAGas worker says he was told to lie
OL,4,Aby supervisor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gas worker said he was told to lie
OL,7,Fabout doing a pressure test by his
OL,8,Fsupervisor prior to an explosion that
OL,9,Fkilled 10 people at a block of flats on
OL,10,F10 December 2022.
OL,12,FJersey's Royal Court has heard the
OL,13,Ffirst police interviews with two
OL,14,Fdefendants Neil Armstrong and John
OL,15,FWright, which took place 10 days after
OL,16,Fthe explosion.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
